{"id":"bdeef7bcba7bf7cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement.md","title":"ZFC Comb Almost Disjoint Refinement","display":"df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement — ZFC Comb Almost Disjoint Refinement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement — ZFC Comb Almost Disjoint Refinement","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-infinite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement — ZFC Comb Almost Disjoint Refinement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be9675f035d2c1e2\" href=\"?note=be9675f035d2c1e2\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-infinite.md\">../batch06/58-df-infinite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in V\">\\(B\\in V\\)</span> (family and indexed refinement)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombAlmostDisjointRefinement}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombAlmostDisjointRefinement}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Infinite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Infinite}\\)</span> (finiteness predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be9675f035d2c1e2\" href=\"?note=be9675f035d2c1e2\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-infinite.md\">../batch06/58-df-infinite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（集合函数谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombAlmostDisjointRefinement}_S(B,A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,A,\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A))\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(B(a)\\subseteq a\\land\\mathrm{Infinite}(B(a))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall a_0,a_1\\in A\\;\\bigl(a_0\\neq a_1\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}(B(a_0)\\cap B(a_1))\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombAlmostDisjointRefinement}_S(B,A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,A,\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A))\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(B(a)\\subseteq a\\land\\mathrm{Infinite}(B(a))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall a_0,a_1\\in A\\;\\bigl(a_0\\neq a_1\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}(B(a_0)\\cap B(a_1))\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(a)\\subseteq a\">\\(B(a)\\subseteq a\\)</span>，所有值都属于集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A)\\)</span>；不需要也不能使用到真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的集合函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-infinite.md","status":"resolved","id":"be9675f035d2c1e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-infinite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Infinite}$ (finiteness predicates, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]] and [[../batch06/58-df-infinite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-infinite.md","status":"resolved","id":"be9675f035d2c1e2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Infinite}$ (finiteness predicates, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]] and [[../batch06/58-df-infinite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$（集合函数谓词，see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombAlmostDisjointRefinement}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Infinite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}refinement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombAlmostDisjointRefinement}_S(B,A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(B,A,\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A))\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(B(a)\\subseteq a\\land\\mathrm{Infinite}(B(a))\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall a_0,a_1\\in A\\;\\bigl(a_0\\neq a_1\\to\n\\mathrm{Finite}(B(a_0)\\cap B(a_1))\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"B(a)\\subseteq a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1393,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1633","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement.md|58-df-zfc-comb-almost-disjoint-refinement]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9a25b0ac94a3598","be9675f035d2c1e2","36d7463d215be751"]}